      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a training module for our senior leadership team. We want to give some advice on \"executive presence\" and grooming to help them look more authoritative during high-stakes boardroom meetings and client presentations. What are some of the key visual cues or grooming standards they should follow to ensure they look professional and commanding?",
